    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "看完以后，老师好奇地问本：",
      "traditional": "看完以後，老師好奇地問本：",
      "pinyin": "kàn wán yǐ hòu lǎo shī hào qí de wèn běn",
      "english": "When class was finished the teacher received Ben’s assignment."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "“你是怎么回事？六千块的手机写成了两千块，",
      "traditional": "“你是怎麼回事？六千塊的手機寫成了兩千塊，",
      "pinyin": "nǐ shì zěn me huí shì liù qiān kuài de shǒu jī xiě chéng le liǎng qiān kuài",
      "english": "After looking at it, the teacher asked Ben curiously, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "十五本书写成了五本，三个人写成了一个人？”",
      "traditional": "十五本書寫成了五本，三個人寫成了一個人？”",
      "pinyin": "shí wǔ běn shū xiě chéng le wǔ běn sān ge rén xiě chéng le yí ge rén",
      "english": ".. “What’s going on? A 6,000 yuan phone has become 2,000 yuan."
